<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss July producer/import prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>Swiss July producer/import prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices was unchanged in July to stand 0.6 percent higher than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>The office provided following details:</p>
<p>				    July '97   June '97   July 1996</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change    0.0	  +0.1	 -0.2</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	+0.6	 +0.4	 -2.6</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	97.6	 97.6	 97.0</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.</p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				    July '97   June '97   July 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change   +0.1	 +0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change     -0.5	 -0.6	 -1.9</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)     97.1	  97.1	97.6</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				    July '97   June '97   July 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change  -0.2	  -0.1	 -0.5</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change    +3.1	  +2.7	 -4.2</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)     98.6	 98.7	 95.6</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
